<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Xynapse Systems Certificate</title>
  <link
    href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,400&family=Cinzel:wght@700&family=Great+Vibes&family=Raleway:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap"
    rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    @page {
      size: 950px 780px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    body,
    html {
      background: #e8e8e8;
      width: 950px;
      height: 780px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      height: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      font-family: 'Raleway', sans-serif;
    }

    .certificate-wrapper {
      width: 950px;
      height: 780px;
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 1.41 / 1;
      background: white;
      padding: 20px;
      position: relative;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
    }

    .outer-border {
      border: 2px solid #C9A84C;
      height: 100%;
      padding: 6px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .inner-border {
      border: 1px solid #C9A84C;
      height: 100%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 30px 50px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .watermark {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      font-size: 400px;
      color: #002B5B;
      opacity: 0.03;
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      user-select: none;
    }

    .ribbon-container {
      position: absolute;
      top: -5px;
      right: 40px;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .blue-ribbon {
      width: 100px;
      height: 150px;
      background: #0a3e79;
      clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 100%, 50% 85%, 0 100%);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      padding-top: 12px;
    }

    .header {
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .main-title {
      font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
      font-size: 52px;
      color: #002B5B;
      letter-spacing: 6px;
      margin-top: 5px;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .sub-title {
      font-size: 16px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      color: #444;
      border-top: 1px solid #C9A84C;
      padding-top: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .proudly {
      font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
      font-style: italic;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-top: 5px;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .student-name {
      font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
      font-size: 52px;
      color: #002B5B;
      margin: 5px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
      min-width: 350px;
      text-align: center;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .body-desc {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #555;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 1.5;
      max-width: 85%;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .details-section {
      display: flex;
      width: 100%;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 10px 0;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .detail-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      width: 30%;
    }

    .icon-circle {
      min-width: 35px;
      height: 35px;
      border: 1.2px solid #002B5B;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #002B5B;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .detail-content h4 {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: #002B5B;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #C9A84C;
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .detail-content p {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #333;
    }

    .footer-row {
      width: 100%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      padding-top: 10px;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    .sig-box {
      text-align: center;
      width: 180px;
    }

    .signature-font {
      font-family: 'Great Vibes', cursive;
      font-size: 24px;
      color: #002B5B;
    }

    .line {
      border-top: 1px solid #C9A84C;
      margin: 4px 0;
    }

    .sig-name {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #002B5B;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .sig-rank {
      font-size: 9px;
      color: #666;
    }

    .seal-circle {
      width: 70px;
      height: 70px;
      border: 1.5px dashed #C9A84C;
      border-radius: 50%;
      padding: 2px;
    }

    .seal-inner {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      border: 1px solid #C9A84C;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .seal-inner span {
      font-size: 7px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #C9A84C;
    }

    .date-box {
      text-align: right;
      width: 150px;
    }

    .date-box p {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #002B5B;
    }

    .date-label {
      font-size: 9px;
      color: #444;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="certificate-wrapper">
    <div class="outer-border">
      <div class="inner-border">
        <div class="watermark">★</div>
        <div class="ribbon-container">
          <div class="blue-ribbon">
            <img
              src="https://png.pngtree.com/png-vector/20220202/ourmid/pngtree-blank-gold-certificate-with-red-ribbon-png-image_4376623.png"
              alt="Medal" style="width: 60px; height: 60px;">
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="header">
          <div class="logo-box">
            <img src="<%= logoBase64 %>" alt="Xynapse Logo"
              style="height: 120px; width: auto; object-fit: contain; z-index: 1;">
          </div>
        </div>

        <h1 class="main-title">CERTIFICATE</h1>
        <p class="sub-title">OF INTERNSHIP</p>

        <p class="proudly">Proudly Certify that</p>
        <div class="student-name">
          <%= name %>
        </div>

        <p class="body-desc">
          has successfully completed the internship program and demonstrated exemplary performance and
          dedication during the tenure.
        </p>

        <div class="details-section">
          <div class="detail-item">
            <div class="icon-circle">📅</div>
            <div class="detail-content">
              <h4>Duration</h4>
              <p>
                <%= certificateData.startDate %> - <%= certificateData.endDate %>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-item">
            <div class="icon-circle">🎓</div>
            <div class="detail-content">
              <h4>Domain</h4>
              <p>
                <%= certificateData.domain %>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-item">
            <div class="icon-circle">🏢</div>
            <div class="detail-content">
              <h4>Location</h4>
              <p>
                <%= certificateData.location %>
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="footer-row">
          <div class="sig-box">
            <div class="signature-font">
              <%= certificateData.signatoryName %>
            </div>
            <div class="line"></div>
            <p class="sig-name">SIGNATORY</p>
            <p class="sig-rank">
              <%= certificateData.signatoryDesignation %>
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="seal-center">
            <div class="seal-circle">
              <div class="seal-inner">
                <span>OFFICIAL</span>
                <span>SEAL</span>
                <span style="font-size: 10px;">★</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="date-box">
            <p>
              <%= certificateData.endDate %>
            </p>
            <div class="line"></div>
            <p class="date-label">ISSUE DATE</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>